claim = success establishes an actual human-operable UEFI keyboard menu whose states and actions are emitted nonvisually by the same native machine-code state machine
claim = success establishes accessibility help recovery status invalid-key feedback and continue confirmation without requiring a visual surface pointer UIA NVDA JAWS or Windows
claim = success does not yet establish native speech braille hardware physical ASUS firmware boot Secure Boot configuration mutation or a complete firmware replacement
